INSERT INTO "Organization" ("id", "name", "tagline", "logoColor", "logoGlyph", "industry", "district", "description", "website", "size", "structure", "workArrangements", "values", "culture", "benefits", "headquarters", "verified", "tier", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "deletedAt", "setupChecklist", "workflows", "leaveAllowances") VALUES
  ('kestrel-systems', 'Kestrel Systems', 'Build. Ship. Learn.', '#2563eb', 'K', 'Software & cloud platforms', 'tech', 'Kestrel Systems builds logistics and payments software for African mid-market businesses. Small autonomous squads own products end to end.', 'https://kestrel.example', '51-200', 'Private limited company · product squads', '{"hybrid","remote"}', '{"Ownership","Curiosity","Candour","Customer obsession"}', '{"environment":"Quiet focus mornings, collaborative afternoons, open demo days every Friday.","leadership":"Servant leadership; managers coach rather than dictate.","collaboration":"Cross-functional squads of 5–8 with written-first decisions.","development":"₦600k annual learning budget and internal mentorship circles.","inclusion":"Structured interviews, pay bands published internally, ERGs.","workLife":"Core hours 10:00–15:00; no meetings on Wednesdays."}', '{"HMO for family","Learning budget","Home-office stipend","Pension match","25 days leave"}', 'Technology Hub, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'enterprise', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{"profile":true,"culture":true,"policies":true,"locations":true,"invite":true,"departments":true,"roles":true,"firstVacancy":true}', '[{"id":"wf-k-hiring","name":"Engineering hiring","steps":["Screen","Technical interview","System design","Values interview","Offer"]},{"id":"wf-k-onboard","name":"New starter onboarding","steps":["Contract signed","Equipment","Accounts","Buddy assigned","30-day check-in"]}]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('amberline-health', 'Amberline Health', 'Care that travels with you', '#dc2626', 'A', 'Healthcare & clinics', 'healthcare', 'A network of community clinics and telehealth services focused on preventive care.', 'https://amberline.example', '11-50', 'Clinic network · regional teams', '{"onsite","hybrid"}', '{"Compassion","Safety","Integrity"}', '{"environment":"Fast-paced clinics with a strong team-huddle culture.","leadership":"Clinical leads with shared decision-making.","collaboration":"Shift handovers and weekly case reviews.","development":"Sponsored certifications and CPD hours.","inclusion":"Flexible shift patterns for carers.","workLife":"Predictable rotas published 4 weeks ahead."}', '{"Health cover","CPD sponsorship","Shift allowances"}', 'Healthcare District, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{"profile":true,"culture":true,"policies":true,"locations":true,"invite":false,"departments":true,"roles":false,"firstVacancy":true}', '[{"id":"wf-a-hiring","name":"Clinical hiring","steps":["Licence check","Panel interview","Shadow shift","Offer"]}]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('copperleaf-finance', 'Copperleaf Finance', 'Money, made understandable', '#b45309', 'C', 'Fintech & banking', 'finance', 'Digital savings and SME lending with transparent pricing.', 'https://copperleaf.example', '201-1000', 'Licensed microfinance group', '{"hybrid"}', '{"Trust","Clarity","Rigour"}', '{"environment":"Structured, compliance-aware, data-driven.","leadership":"Clear accountability with quarterly OKRs.","collaboration":"Risk, product and engineering pair on every launch.","development":"ICAN/ACCA exam support.","inclusion":"Women-in-finance programme.","workLife":"Hybrid 3 days onsite."}', '{"Pension match","Staff loans","Exam support"}', 'Finance District, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('saffron-salt', 'Saffron & Salt Hospitality', 'Every guest, a story', '#ea580c', 'S', 'Hotels & restaurants', 'hospitality', 'Boutique hotels and restaurants celebrating West African cuisine.', 'https://saffronsalt.example', '51-200', 'Hospitality group', '{"onsite"}', '{"Warmth","Craft","Teamwork"}', '{"environment":"Energetic, guest-first, hands-on.","leadership":"Leaders work the floor alongside teams.","collaboration":"Kitchen and front-of-house brigades.","development":"Chef apprenticeships and management track.","inclusion":"Hiring from local communities.","workLife":"Rotating rosters with guaranteed 2 consecutive rest days."}', '{"Staff meals","Service charge share","Travel discounts"}', 'Hospitality District, Grooveli City', FALSE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('halcyon-creative', 'Halcyon Creative Co.', 'Stories worth sharing', '#db2777', 'H', 'Creative agency', 'creative', 'Brand, film and music production studio for purpose-led brands.', 'https://halcyon.example', '11-50', 'Studio collective', '{"hybrid","remote"}', '{"Imagination","Craft","Generosity"}', '{"environment":"Studio vibe, crit sessions, music on.","leadership":"Creative directors as mentors.","collaboration":"Small pods per client.","development":"Conference and festival budget.","inclusion":"Paid internships only.","workLife":"Four-day weeks in August."}', '{"Gear allowance","Festival passes","Flexible hours"}', 'Creative District, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('meridian-talent', 'Meridian Talent Partners', 'People first, placements second', '#d97706', 'M', 'Recruitment & HR services', 'recruitment', 'Specialist recruiters for tech, finance and healthcare roles.', 'https://meridian.example', '11-50', 'Partnership', '{"hybrid"}', '{"Honesty","Fit over speed"}', '{"environment":"Supportive desk with shared targets.","leadership":"Partner-led.","collaboration":"Shared candidate pools.","development":"CIPD sponsorship.","inclusion":"Blind CV screening.","workLife":"Hybrid with Friday afternoons off."}', '{"Commission","Health cover"}', 'Recruitment Agency, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('grooveli-academy', 'Grooveli Academy', 'Learn the skills employers ask for', '#16a34a', 'G', 'Education & training', 'university', 'Short courses, certifications and career bootcamps (synthetic catalogue).', 'https://academy.grooveli.example', '11-50', 'Training provider', '{"remote","onsite"}', '{"Access","Practice","Progress"}', '{"environment":"Teaching-first, learner-obsessed.","leadership":"Faculty council.","collaboration":"Co-teaching.","development":"Teach-to-learn sabbaticals.","inclusion":"Scholarships.","workLife":"Term-based schedules."}', '{"Free courses","Flexible terms"}', 'University District, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('orbitwell-analytics', 'Orbitwell Analytics', 'Decisions, illuminated', '#4f46e5', 'O', 'Data & consulting', 'corporate', 'Analytics consulting for retail and public-sector clients.', 'https://orbitwell.example', '51-200', 'Consultancy', '{"hybrid","onsite"}', '{"Evidence","Clarity","Service"}', '{"environment":"Client-facing with strong internal guilds.","leadership":"Engagement managers own outcomes.","collaboration":"Practice guilds.","development":"Certification sprints.","inclusion":"Returnship programme.","workLife":"Bench weeks after big engagements."}', '{"Bonus","Certifications","HMO"}', 'Corporate District, Grooveli City', TRUE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}'),
  ('tidewater-logistics', 'Tidewater Logistics', 'On time, every time', '#0f766e', 'T', 'Logistics & supply chain', 'corporate', 'Last-mile delivery and warehousing across the region.', 'https://tidewater.example', '201-1000', 'Operating company', '{"onsite"}', '{"Reliability","Safety","Pace"}', '{"environment":"Operational, metrics-driven.","leadership":"Site managers with clear SLAs.","collaboration":"Daily stand-ups per hub.","development":"Supervisor academy.","inclusion":"Accessible warehouses.","workLife":"Shift-based."}', '{"Transport allowance","Overtime pay","Life insurance"}', 'Corporate District, Grooveli City', FALSE, 'starter', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', '2026-11-09 09:00:00.000', NULL, '{}', '[]', '{"annual":25,"sick":10,"parental":60,"study":5,"unpaid":30}')
